    "d2cf3c0b-ebed-43bf-a37a-55b9af30eac4": {
      "type": "section__image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--15495804813405__d2cf3c0b-ebed-43bf-a37a-55b9af30eac4-title-1": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "content": "Hi, I\u2019m Kathy!",
            "textColor": "#261514",
            "fontFamily": "title",
            "fontSize": "medium"
          }
        },
        "template--15495804813405__d2cf3c0b-ebed-43bf-a37a-55b9af30eac4-richText-1": {
          "type": "richText",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": true,
            "maxBWidth": 100,
            "content": "<p>I\u2019ve been creating sprinkle mixes for over 15 years. I\u2019m a regular mom/grandma who wants to help other regular moms create cute things for their kids \u2014 without spending a ton of money.\u00a0</p><p>I started Cool Mom Sprinkles to encourage and uplift you to create cute treats that look fantastic and leave you feeling good.\u00a0</p><p>Every single sprinkle is hand mixed and packaged with love. You can use them to turn ordinary desserts into something special \u2014 with confidence and ease.</p><p>As moms, we want everything to be perfect for our families \u2014 because we love them\u2026</p><p>But when you scroll on Pinterest to bake the <em>picture perfect dessert</em>, you have to sort through recipes that take too much time and money to recreate \u2014 that can sometimes leave you feeling inadequate.</p><p>I don\u2019t want anyone to <em>ever</em> feel like they can\u2019t make something cute because it\u2019s not insta-worthy, it\u2019s too expensive, or it\u2019s too complicated. That\u2019s why I created a go-to tool and secret weapon for bakers everywhere \u2013 Cool Mom Sprinkles.\u00a0</p><p>Here at Cool Mom Sprinkles, our goal is to empower moms and bakers everywhere to be able to whip up something simple and make it wonderful \u2013 without spending the whole day in the kitchen.</p><p>Because when you can make something special in a matter of minutes, you can spend the rest of the day doing the things that matter the most.</p>",
            "detectLists": true,
            "textColor": "#000000",
            "fontFamily": "base",
            "fontSize": "base"
          }
        },
        "template--15495804813405__d2cf3c0b-ebed-43bf-a37a-55b9af30eac4-button-1": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "fullWidth": false,
